# CustomerPortalAPI git target

Push this repository to the `dev2` branch on the `CustomerPortalAPI` remote (`https://github.com/saibrandingarc/CustomerPortalAPI.git`).

- After API changes, commit the source files and push `dev2`.
- Confirm the push by comparing local `dev2` with `CustomerPortalAPI/dev2`. They must point at the same commit.
- Do not commit secrets or build output: `appsettings.json`, credential JSON, and `publish.zip`.
- Do not push `dev` or `main` unless the user explicitly asks.
